FRTRIAGE1
---ENTRY---
README.txt
This file lives inside a mounted mini-archive, not on the real filesystem.
It demonstrates lazy, on-demand FileSystemFactory-based mounting: the outer
VfsProvider only ever sees this whole .frtriage file as opaque bytes. Crossing
into its contents happens on first access, via resources/read's [mount]
convention, and is cached afterward.
---ENTRY---
logs/note.txt
A second file, under a subdirectory, to show directory listing inside the
mounted filesystem too.
